cpmdev       Historical CP/M/CCP sources, assemblers and libraries
ABDOS.SUB    Historical build recipe; expects missing ABDOS.Z80
ASM.COM      Digital Research 8080 assembler: ASM NAME -> HEX/PRN
CLEAN.SUB    CAUTION: deletes HEX/PRN/SYM/BAK/BIN; use disposable copy
MAC.COM      Digital Research macro assembler; used by CCP/BDOS builds
MLOAD.COM    Load/link Intel HEX files; used by historical SUB builds
Z80ASM.COM   SLR Z80 assembler: Z80ASM NAME -> COM from NAME.Z80
ZSID.COM     Z80 symbolic debugger
ZTRAN.COM    8080 to Z80 source translator; see bundled documentation
